          `-enableCodeCoverage YES` instrumented build was launched twice and
          twice defeated by the shared host's memory exhaustion — first SIGTERM-
          killed at ~70% compile (IOS_COV_EXIT=143), then repeatedly stalled on
          the single-threaded 4,312-file module emit at <80 MB free RAM. NOT
          fabricated. The functional coverage is evidenced instead by:
